msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"

msgid "1 = 勘 ・ 3 = 部分的に理解 ・ 5 = 説明できる"
msgstr "1 = Guess, 3 = Partial understanding, 5 = Can explain"

msgid "1〜2文でOKです"
msgstr "1-2 sentences is fine"

msgid "AIのヒントなしで解いてください。"
msgstr "Solve this without AI hints."

msgid "Complete! 🎉"
msgstr "Complete! 🎉"

msgid "「追加」を押すと、セクションが自動生成されます。"
msgstr "Sections will be generated automatically when you press \"Add\"."

msgid "おすすめのセクション"
msgstr "Recommended sections"

msgid "ここにファイルをドラッグ&ドロップ"
msgstr "Drag & drop files here"

msgid "ここに回答を入力してください"
msgstr "Enter your answer here"

msgid "ここに解答を入力してください"
msgstr "Enter your answer here"

msgid "このコースはComplete!です 🎉"
msgstr "This course is Complete! 🎉"

msgid "この科目に入る前に、いくつかの問題を解いて今の理解度を確認しましょう。"
msgstr "Before starting this subject, let's check your current understanding with a few questions."

msgid "この科目を削除しますか？"
msgstr "Delete this subject?"

msgid "この科目を追加"
msgstr "Add this subject"

msgid "どう考えて修正したか説明してください"
msgstr "Explain how you thought about the correction"

msgid "どう考えて解いたか説明してください"
msgstr "Explain how you thought about solving it"

msgid "もう少し練習するとよさそうな点"
msgstr "Areas that could use more practice"

msgid "サンプル"
msgstr "Sample"

msgid "セクションがまだありません。"
msgstr "There are no sections yet."

msgid "セクション一覧へ進む"
msgstr "Go to section list"

msgid "ホームに戻る"
msgstr "Back to home"

msgid "メニュー"
msgstr "Menu"

msgid "不正解"
msgstr "Incorrect"

msgid "不正解でした。誤解を明らかにするための質問です。"
msgstr "That was incorrect. Here's a question to help identify the misunderstanding."

msgid "例: x = 4"
msgstr "e.g. x = 4"

msgid "例: 二次関数、微分の基礎"
msgstr "e.g. Quadratic functions, Basics of differentiation"

msgid "再提出"
msgstr "Resubmit"

msgid "削除"
msgstr "Delete"

msgid "参考ファイルをダウンロード"
msgstr "Download reference file"

msgid "参考ファイル（任意・複数可）"
msgstr "Reference files (optional, multiple allowed)"

msgid "資料"
msgstr "Materials"

msgid "資料を追加"
msgstr "Add material"

msgid "追加"
msgstr "Add"

msgid "資料はまだありません。"
msgstr "No materials yet."

msgid "回答して次へ"
msgstr "Answer and continue"

msgid "回答する"
msgstr "Answer"

msgid "学習の記録"
msgstr "Learning record"

msgid "提出"
msgstr "Submit"

msgid "わからない"
msgstr "I don't know"

msgid "もう一度考える"
msgstr "Think again"

msgid "ヒント レベル1"
msgstr "Hint level 1"

msgid "数学"
msgstr "Math"

msgid "新しい科目を追加"
msgstr "Add a new subject"

msgid "最初からやり直す"
msgstr "Start over"

msgid "最初の解答"
msgstr "First attempt"

msgid "最後に、今回の考え方を自分の言葉で確認してみましょう。長い説明は必要ありません（目安10〜20秒、1〜2文でOKです）。"
msgstr "Finally, let's check your thinking in your own words. A long explanation isn't necessary (about 10-20 seconds, 1-2 sentences is fine)."

msgid "未選択でも追加できます"
msgstr "You can add it even without selecting a file"

msgid "次のおすすめ:"
msgstr "Next recommendation:"

msgid "正解"
msgstr "Correct"

msgid "正解でした！自信度が低かったので、理解を確認します。"
msgstr "That was correct! Since your confidence was low, let's check your understanding."

msgid "理解の証拠"
msgstr "Evidence of understanding"

msgid "理解度の自己評価と結果に少しズレがあります。次は自信度も意識して答えてみましょう。"
msgstr "There's a slight mismatch between your self-assessed understanding and the result. Try being mindful of your confidence next time."

msgid "科目"
msgstr "Subject"

msgid "科目を選んで診断からTransfer Checkまで進めましょう。学び終えた分だけ、コースの達成率が積み上がります。"
msgstr "Choose a subject and work from the diagnostic through to the Transfer Check. Your course completion rate builds up as you learn."

msgid "科目名"
msgstr "Subject name"

msgid "科目名を入力し、参考資料があればドラッグ&ドロップしてください。セクション構成は自動で作成されます。"
msgstr "Enter a subject name, and drag & drop reference material if you have any. The section structure will be created automatically."

msgid "考え方"
msgstr "Reasoning"

msgid "考え方の説明"
msgstr "Explanation of your reasoning"

msgid "自信度"
msgstr "Confidence"

msgid "解答"
msgstr "Answer"

msgid "解答（修正版）"
msgstr "Answer (revised)"

msgid "診断クイズ"
msgstr "Diagnostic quiz"

msgid "診断結果"
msgstr "Diagnostic result"

msgid "達成率"
msgstr "Completion rate"

msgid "選択中"
msgstr "Selected"

msgid "（またはクリックして選択、複数選択可）"
msgstr "(or click to select, multiple files allowed)"

msgid "（最終手段）"
msgstr "(last resort)"

msgid "達成率 %(percent)s%%（%(mastered)s/%(total)s）"
msgstr "Completion rate %(percent)s%% (%(mastered)s/%(total)s)"

msgid "セクション %(n)s"
msgstr "Section %(n)s"

msgid "コース達成率 %(course_percent)s%%"
msgstr "Course completion %(course_percent)s%%"

msgid "ヒント レベル%(level)s"
msgstr "Hint level %(level)s"

msgid "これまでのヒントを見る（%(count_hints)s件）"
msgstr "View previous hints (%(count_hints)s)"

msgid "レベル%(level)s:"
msgstr "Level %(level)s:"

msgid "今回つまずいたポイント: %(point)s"
msgstr "What tripped you up this time: %(point)s"

msgid "修正 %(n)s"
msgstr "Revision %(n)s"

msgid "使用したヒント（%(count_hints)s件）"
msgstr "Hints used (%(count_hints)s)"

msgid "診断問題 %(current)s / %(total)s"
msgstr "Diagnostic question %(current)s / %(total)s"

msgid "%(total)s 問正解"
msgstr "%(total)s correct"

msgid "%(total)sセクション"
msgstr "%(total)s sections"

msgid "「%(name)s」はすでに登録されています。"
msgstr "\"%(name)s\" is already registered."

msgid "この学習セッションをリセットしました。"
msgstr "This learning session has been reset."

msgid "サンプル科目は削除できません。"
msgstr "The sample subject cannot be deleted."

msgid "不明な操作です。"
msgstr "Unknown action."

msgid "不正なリクエストです。"
msgstr "Invalid request."

msgid "ファイルを選択してください。"
msgstr "Please select a file."

msgid "資料を追加しました。"
msgstr "Material added."

msgid "修正"
msgstr "Revision"

msgid "完了"
msgstr "Done"

msgid "新しい問題から、この学習セッションを始めます。"
msgstr "Starting this learning session over with a new question."

msgid "次のヒントを確認してみましょう。"
msgstr "Take a look at the next hint."

msgid "理解が確認できました。"
msgstr "Your understanding has been confirmed."

msgid "確認"
msgstr "Verification"

msgid "確認質問への回答を保存しました。"
msgstr "Your answer to the verification question has been saved."

msgid "科目名を入力してください。"
msgstr "Please enter a subject name."

msgid "診断"
msgstr "Diagnosis"

msgid "診断クイズがまだ完了していません。"
msgstr "The diagnostic quiz is not yet complete."

msgid "診断質問への回答を保存しました。"
msgstr "Your answer to the diagnostic question has been saved."

msgid "Mastered"
msgstr "Mastered"

msgid "再確認の時期です"
msgstr "Time for a recheck"

msgid "未着手"
msgstr "Not started"

msgid "理解途中"
msgstr "In progress"

msgid "自信不足かもしれません"
msgstr "May be underconfident"

msgid "自信過剰かもしれません"
msgstr "May be overconfident"

msgid "要復習"
msgstr "Needs review"

msgid "AIの助けなしで解く応用問題（Transfer Check）に進みます。"
msgstr "Moving on to an application problem (Transfer Check) you'll solve without AI help."

msgid "この単元は習得（Mastered）と判定されました。"
msgstr "This unit has been marked as Mastered."

msgid "ヒントを見ながら解答を修正します。"
msgstr "Revise your answer using the hints."

msgid "不正解だったので、誤解を診断する質問に進みます。"
msgstr "That was incorrect, so let's move to a question that diagnoses the misunderstanding."

msgid "復習が必要です。"
msgstr "This needs review."

msgid "正解でしたが自信度が低いので、理解を確認する質問に進みます。"
msgstr "That was correct, but since your confidence was low, let's move to a question to check your understanding."

msgid "自分の言葉で説明するTeach-Backに進みます。"
msgstr "Moving on to Teach-Back, where you explain it in your own words."

msgid "Teach-Backの回答を入力してください。"
msgstr "Please enter your Teach-Back answer."

msgid "Teach-Backの質問が見つかりません。"
msgstr "The Teach-Back question could not be found."

msgid "Teach-Backはこのステップでは利用できません。"
msgstr "Teach-Back is not available at this step."

msgid "Transfer Checkはこのステップでは利用できません。"
msgstr "Transfer Check is not available at this step."

msgid "Transfer Checkはすでに提出済みです。"
msgstr "The Transfer Check has already been submitted."

msgid "この問題はすでに回答済みか、存在しません。"
msgstr "This question has already been answered, or does not exist."

msgid "この診断クイズはすでに完了しています。"
msgstr "This diagnostic quiz has already been completed."

msgid "修正の提出はこのステップでは利用できません。"
msgstr "Submitting a revision is not available at this step."

msgid "回答を入力してください。"
msgstr "Please enter an answer."

msgid "最初の解答はこのステップでは提出できません。"
msgstr "The first attempt cannot be submitted at this step."

msgid "最初の解答はすでに提出済みです。"
msgstr "The first attempt has already been submitted."

msgid "確認質問に回答してから進んでください。"
msgstr "Please answer the verification question before continuing."

msgid "確認質問はこのステップでは利用できません。"
msgstr "The verification question is not available at this step."

msgid "自信度を選択してください。"
msgstr "Please select a confidence level."

msgid "解答と考え方の説明の両方を入力してください。"
msgstr "Please enter both your answer and an explanation of your reasoning."

msgid "診断質問に回答してから進んでください。"
msgstr "Please answer the diagnostic question before continuing."

msgid "診断質問はこのステップでは利用できません。"
msgstr "The diagnostic question is not available at this step."


msgid "この科目にはまだセクションがありません。科目にセクションが追加されると診断クイズが出題されます。"
msgstr "This subject doesn't have any sections yet. Once sections are added, the diagnostic quiz will start."

msgid ""
"%(total)s問すべて正解でした。この科目の基礎はすでに身についているようです。"
"発展的なセクションから取り組んでみましょう。"
msgstr ""
"You got all %(total)s questions correct. It looks like you already have "
"the basics of this subject down — try starting from a more advanced section."

msgid ""
"%(total)s問中%(correct)s問正解でした。理解度は「普通」です。"
"間違えた問題に対応するセクションを優先的に復習しましょう。"
msgstr ""
"You got %(correct)s of %(total)s questions correct. Your understanding "
"looks solid overall — review the sections tied to the questions you missed first."

msgid ""
"%(total)s問中%(correct)s問正解でした。理解度は「要復習」です。"
"基礎のセクションから順番に進めることをおすすめします。"
msgstr ""
"You got %(correct)s of %(total)s questions correct. This subject needs "
"more review — we recommend working through the sections in order, starting from the basics."
